						</div>
						<div aria-hidden='false' data-gtm-section="carousel" data-gtm-subsection="gifts" class="carousel-item">
								<img src="/assets/images/welcome/carousel/nov26-gifts.jpg" class="d-block" alt="Holiday gifts available in the Postal Store.">
								
								<div class="carousel-caption d-md-block" style="position:relative;">
									<h2 class="header-2">Holiday Gifts</h2>
									<p>Add some sparkle to your tree with our USPS<sup>&reg;</sup> ornaments. See our entire collection of special holiday gifts.</p>
									<p class="carousel-button">
										<a data-gtm-section="carousel" data-gtm-subsection="gifts" data-gtm-label="shop-now" class="button--primary" href="https://store.example.test/store/results?Ntt=Ornaments#content">Shop Now</a>
									</p>
